   104	## 3. Principal-minor pullback and order conversion
   105	
   106	Notation follows the computation: `F` is the degree-99 coordinate (Xu/Moh's
   107	`g`) and `G` the degree-66 coordinate (Xu/Moh's `f`).  Set
   108	
   109	```text
   110	t=s^2,
   111	w=u*s^4+v*s^6+pi*s^7,
   112	z=w-1=-1+u*s^4+v*s^6+pi*s^7,
   113	KF=t^99 F=s^198 F,
   114	KG=t^66 G=s^132 G.
   115	```
   116	
   117	The charged chart gives localized series `H,A2,A3,B1,B2` and the literal map
   118	
   119	```text
   120	KF = H^3 + EF,       EF=A2*H+A3,
   121	KG = H^2 + EG,       EG=B1*H+B2.
   122	```
   123	
   124	At the second point and `delta=5/2`, the promoted root datum is
   125	
   126	```text
   127	p=pi*(pi^2-c),
   128	q1=-2*integral(p^3 d pi)
   129	  =-pi^10/5+3*c*pi^8/4-c^2*pi^6+c^3*pi^4/2,
   130	```
   131	
   132	with the integration constant normalized to zero.  The exact control verifies
   133	`d(q1)/d(pi)=-2*p^3`; `p^10*q1` has pi-degree 40.
   134	
   135	Here `c!=0`, and the three roots of `p` carry the charged `9+9+9` packet
   136	data; this is imported root data, not re-derived from the stage-7 equations.
   137	Xu's displayed exponents give
   138	
   139	```text
   140	ord_t T2 = 5*(-8+3*delta) = -5/2,
   141	ord_t T3 = 13*(-8+3*delta)-1+delta = -5.
   142	```
   143	
   144	Thus `T2` has actual `s`-order `-5`, and `T3` actual `s`-order `-10`.
   145	Multiplying by `s^396` and `s^1188` moves their leaders to `s^391` and
   146	`s^1178`, respectively.  These calculations agree with Xu, section 8,
