   245	## 6. Exact Q-star prefix and dimension accounting
   246	
   247	`t2_first_row.py` reconstructed the exact localized blocks through `s^56`,
   248	formed the structurally cancelled monic residual, and found precisely the
   249	row printed above.  Its canonical SymPy-representation hash is
   250	`4726401ff9500a13ee18e5c3b31d1133d7a187fe62400f5903188d14aa599167`.
   251	This monic residual is the full U2 coefficient there: normalized `KF` and
   252	`KG` start at `s^24` and `s^16`, so the four T2 columns first occur at
   253	`s^106`, `s^280`, `s^222`, and `s^396`, respectively.
   254	Exact affine reduction gives
   255	
   256	```text
   257	pivot variable: B1c_7_19
   258	pivot coefficient: -98304 in Q*
   259	right side: B1c_7_20-B1c_7_21+B1c_7_22-B1c_7_23+B1c_7_24-B1c_7_25
   260	residual rows: 0
   261	```
   262	
   263	The run exited zero after 313.74 seconds with 209,612 KiB peak RSS.  Its
   264	emitted Singular check has eight active ambient variables plus the wrapper
   265	(nine ring variables), and 899 inactive free variables.  The normal form of `1` modulo the row and
   266	`Zc*c-1` is `1` (so the ideal is not unit), and Singular reports active
   267	dimension 7, hence full dimension `7+899=906`.  The negative wrapper control
   268	`(c,Zc*c-1)` is unit; the positive `c=1` wrapper control is not.
   269	
   270	This also has a Jacobian-localized positive control.  In the exact stage-7
   271	chart, set
   272	
   273	```text
   274	c=1, A3c_97_1=-1, B2c_64_0=1,
   275	all other stage-7 free generators=0.
   276	```
   277	
   278	Then the first T2 row is zero and the genuine charged degree-zero coefficient
   279	`J0=[t^163 w^0]J` is exactly `1`.  The independent verifier exited zero and
   280	records the canonical J0 hash
   281	`eced81485fa88f5ecf3f130463c78e2158c6a1bbe63b7457c16cb5130e3c9b04`.
   282	The Q-star pivot makes the one-row quotient a domain; this point proves that
   283	`J0` is nonzero in it.  Its nonempty principal open therefore retains
   284	dimension 906 after localization at `c*J0`.  Adjoining the constant-term
   285	parameter `kappa` with `J0-kappa` has zero net dimension
   286	effect.  Adding the separate slice equation `c-1` gives dimension 905.
   287	This point controls only the one-row localization; it is not claimed to
