   430	## 11. Next exact system
   431	
   432	The continuation contract is
   433	`box/g9966d52bridge-20260903/next-system.json`.  It is a manifest, not an
   434	executable.  The low-prefix driver currently accepts caps below `s^132`, and
   435	the monolithic full emitters are replayable; filtered emitters above `s^131`
   436	and for staged T3 remain to be implemented.  To avoid repeating the
   437	monolithic memory failure, the contract prescribes:
   438	
   439	1. continue T2 in caps `70,100,150,220,300,391`;
   440	2. substitute each certified Q-star pivot through every retained row and
   441	   rebuild the component series;
   442	3. add T3 in increasing caps through `1178`;
   443	4. union the promoted F/G minor-face rows and parallel Jacobian bands;
   444	5. adjoin `J0-kappa` and `Zck*c*kappa-1` (or the separately declared `J0=1`
   445	   normalization);
   446	6. run denominator-audited `GF(32003)`, `GF(104729)`, `GF(1299709)`, then
   447	   exact `Q` under `timeout 3000` per stage;
   448	7. only if the exact remainder is unit, emit and independently verify the
   449	   rational lift identity.
   450	
   451	The generated monolithic scripts remain useful replay/fallback systems, but
   452	their existence is not a computation result.
   453	
   454	## 12. FALLACY-v2 audit and theorem dependency
   455	
   456	* Flag/place/series: the cv flag, second physical point, formal pi-root, and
   457	  pulled-back series remain separately typed.
   458	* Carrier/attainment and floor/attainment: support and a necessary row do not
   459	  prove an attained full Keller pair or an exact full-ideal dimension.
   460	* Saturation: rings, maps, wrappers, and controls are explicit; no `sat()`
   461	  output is silently rewrapped.
   462	* Raw leaders: only a rational constant was used as a pivot.  Vanishing
   463	  chart-dependent leaders must branch.
   464	* Variable/ring map: the charged generator order and images are checked; name
   465	  equality is not used as proof.
   466	* Prime labels are characteristics, not derivatives.  `q1'` above denotes the
   467	  explicitly checked derivative with respect to `pi`.
   468	* Merge-free/M-descent and target/arrival indices are not invoked.
   469	* No exit-price assertion is made, so no exit-charge declaration is present.
   470	
   471	The theorem “no Keller pair with the (99,66) skeleton” would require, at a
   472	minimum, the already promoted skeleton and branch-B gate, a source-licensed
   473	delta-5/2 root/face bridge, the full minor-face and Jacobian union, safe
   474	localization at every nonzero factor, closure of all remaining branches, and
   475	an exact rational unit certificate.  This lane supplies only a conditional
   476	necessary cut and replayable next systems.  It therefore cannot state that
   477	theorem.
